              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asu onthe matikamũtila ngelekan’yo, na kũmũkũlũla nthimo, makyasya, Woo nĩ wa ũla wongeleelaa kĩla kĩte kyake! Nĩ kũvika ĩndĩĩ? Na wa ũla wĩkuĩthasya mũio wa ngwatĩlĩlyo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
